0..77 Comment "// A statement inside a block a binder reads. The statement is a split of its"
78..152 Comment "// unit result, and a split whose components its body\'s type does not read"
153..225 Comment "// synthesises that type, as a bind does: an elimination whose principal"
226..303 Comment "// premise synthesises synthesises (Dunfield and Krishnaswami, \"Bidirectional"
304..372 Comment "// Typing\", ACM Computing Surveys 54(5), 2021, doi:10.1145/3450952)."
